1560 0 obj
<<
/Title (Parala Maharaja Engineering College \(PMEC\), Berhampur, established on 26 April 2009, is the only Government Engineering College in South Odisha. Autonomous since 2021 and affiliated with BPUT, Odisha, the institute offers 8 B.Tech, 7 M.Tech, and Ph.D. research programmes. Spread across an 80-acre campus with modern academic infrastructure, advanced laboratories, a central library, workshops, hostels, and research facilities, PMEC is committed to excellence in technical education, innovation, and the production of industry-ready engineers. Located in the historic Silk City of Berhampur, Odisha, the institute provides an ideal environment for learning, research, and technological advancement.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1281 0 R
/Prev 1553 0 R
/Next 1554 0 R
>>
